listening practice into a lively daily routine.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/extras\/3c41d2764afa0287c844a3fefe8edc42.avif?t=1793717563\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/extras_big\/3c41d2764afa0287c844a3fefe8edc42.avif?t=1793717563 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch anime and sing in Japanese<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get a television for camp and watch Japanese anime with your companions! Japanese subtitles come with translations and furigana, alongside companion explanations, personal notes, and review quizzes. Dialogue from the stories becomes another way to learn Japanese.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The karaoke room features Japanese songs with original vocals, line-by-line lyric explanations, and sing-along word challenges. Get to know a song you enjoy, then try keeping up with its rhythm!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Read a book or tune in to camp radio<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 42 Japanese books with translations and narration, word-by-word highlighting, and shadowing practice. Work your way from short stories toward literary works and longer passages. Camp radio offers 234 weather reports across six levels, from kana to N1, for a little listening during a break.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A camp full of familiar faces<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions arrive as your journey unfolds. Conversations, gifts, and quests gradually reveal their pasts. Japanese dialogue includes translations and language notes, while the real-time 3D camp changes its scenery with the regions you explore.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/extras\/48324d93fcf8048983df8829b46b21d2.avif?t=1793717563\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/extras_big\/48324d93fcf8048983df8829b46b21d2.avif?t=1793717563 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A thirty-second sprint, or a duel with friends<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fit a 30-second quiz sprint into your day, or gather up to eight people in the friend lobby for chat and PvP quiz duels with Steam friends. Your equipment progression and spell combinations come along for these friendly matches. Steam leaderboards track your achievements on the journey and let you display your own crest.<\/p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/extras\/45884baeb11a3601f050748f1a426e21.avif?t=1793717563\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/extras_big\/45884baeb11a3601f050748f1a426e21.avif?t=1793717563 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick up your weapon and open your dictionary. Your next expedition begins with the words you learn today.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"Learn Japanese from kana to JLPT N1 in an RPG adventure with 8,800+ words, 690+ grammar points, and spaced review. Collect gear, explore forests, run a burger shop, watch anime with companions, and learn Japanese songs. Read, listen, or challenge Steam friends to quiz duels.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/8a2deb8b4a4bbb7029dbc21fc75eb22602cfb961\/header.jpg?t=1793717563","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/430ee17e0c6f2023d6055897969cbaf3e17a9bb5\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793717563","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5230220\/430ee17e0c6f2023d6055897969cbaf3e17a9bb5\/capsule_184x69